ign.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "clienteId sale del claim, nunca del body; failed-precondition si no est\u00e1 habilitada."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_08_notificaciones_web_pwa_design_enviarnotificacion", "label": "enviarNotificacion (trigger onDocumentCreated)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-notificaciones-web-pwa-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trigger y no callable porque la app no tiene el SDK de Functions y la escritura en Firestore se encola sin se\u00f1al."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_08_notificaciones_web_pwa_design_notificaciones_ts_functions", "label": "functions/src/notificaciones.ts (l\u00f3gica pura de env\u00edo)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-notificaciones-web-pwa-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_08_notificaciones_web_pwa_design_sendeachformulticast", "label": "sendEachForMulticast por token, tandas de 500, solo datos, TTL 4h", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-notificaciones-web-pwa-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mensajes solo de datos para evitar notificaci\u00f3n doble; TTL 4h porque un 'ya llegamos' del d\u00eda siguiente confunde."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_08_notificaciones_web_pwa_design_sin_temas_fcm", "label": "Env\u00edo por token en vez de temas FCM", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-notificaciones-web-pwa-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "ratio